Build succeeds. Here's what was created:

**`Components/ScreenSize.cs`** — Enum with `Mobile`, `Tablet`, `Desktop` values.

**`Components/ScreenSizeProvider.razor`** — Wraps `ChildContent` in a `<CascadingValue>`. Uses JS interop to listen for `resize` events and classifies the viewport width into the appropriate category. Defaults to `Desktop`.

**`Components/ScreenSizeProvider.razor.js`** — Colocated JS module that reports `window.innerWidth` on init and on every resize.

Child components consume the value with:

```razor
@code {
    [CascadingParameter]
    public ScreenSize ScreenSize { get; set; }
}
```
